[system]
{{> principles}}

Task: classify search intent for a batch of real Search Console queries. A rule-based classifier already produced a first guess and a confidence; correct it only when you are confident it is wrong.
Intent values: informational, commercial, transactional, navigational, local.
Keyword types: primary, secondary, long_tail, local, question, commercial.
Recommended page types: service_page, location_section, blog_article, faq_entry, comparison_article, homepage, contact_page, case_study.
